# Google OAuth — template (safe to commit)

Copy to `secrets/google-oauth.local.md` (gitignored) and fill real values from
Google Cloud → Credentials → OAuth client JSON download.

Project id example: `cosy-ai-oauth`  
Supabase project: `uotvcsjoriamsagfprbq`

## Paste into Supabase → Authentication → Providers → Google

- **Client ID:** `YOUR_CLIENT_ID.apps.googleusercontent.com`
- **Client Secret:** `YOUR_CLIENT_SECRET`

## Google Cloud must have

Authorized redirect URI:

```
https://uotvcsjoriamsagfprbq.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
```

Authorized JavaScript origins (examples):

```
https://cosy-app-kit.vercel.app
http://127.0.0.1:8080
http://localhost:8080
```

## Supabase Auth → URL configuration → Redirect URLs

```
https://cosy-app-kit.vercel.app/auth
http://127.0.0.1:8080/auth
```

## Checklist

1. External audience + Test users (while in Testing mode).
2. Enable Google provider in Supabase with Client ID/Secret.
3. `bun run verify:google-oauth` → expect `302` to `accounts.google.com`.
4. Never commit `*.local.md` or the Google `client_secret_*.json`.
